{
  "about": "untrusted::defang and the app's defang (D-3025, D-3029): characters nothing shows (the default-ignorable code points) are dropped first; then every run of @ becomes ＠, the whole run, unless a space, tab, LF or CR follows it (a run joins whatever follows it, and the end of one text is the start of whatever comes next; typing into a terminal drops every other control character, a form feed too); the [ that opens one of Claude Code's paste markers ([Pasted text #1], [Image #2], [...Truncated text #3 +4 lines...], [✦ Team setup guide #5]) becomes ［; and ultra before code, plan, review or think, in any case, gets a hyphen. Both suites read this file.",
